OL,3,GUK long range forecast                 
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 30 Nov to Wed 9 Dec    
OL,6,FWeather systems moving in from the     
OL,7,FAtlantic will continue to try to push  
OL,8,Feastwards across the UK, but will tend 
OL,9,Fto stall as they encounter high        
OL,10,Fpressure to the north and northeast.   
OL,11,FAs a result, further spells of rain or 
OL,12,Fshowers are likely at times. These may 
OL,13,Fbe heavy and persistent, especially in 
OL,14,Fthe south and west, with the best of   
OL,15,Fany drier interludes in the far north  
OL,16,Fand northeast. Whilst mild conditions  
OL,17,Fare expected to encroach into the      
OL,18,Fsouth and southwest at times, it is    
OL,19,Flikely to turn somewhat colder through 
OL,20,Fthe period, bringing a risk of snow,   
OL,21,Fmost likely over hills in Scotland and 
OL,22,Fnorthern England, but perhaps          
OL,23,Fextending to other areas with time.fice
